    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED) hosted a thought-provoking Kazim Bacchus Research Seminar led by Dr Rabia Nauman, a distinguished scholar in moral education and Director for AKU-IED's new Bachelor of Education programme. The seminar brought together educators and scholars to explore and understand the critical need for a balanced approach to moral education in Pakistan's diverse educational landscape.",
